flowchart TD
    %% commands: query.run, query.cancel, query.results, transaction.get
    start([Explicit SQL run]) --> lookup{Authenticated admitted token exists}
    lookup -->|Yes| status([Original operation and epoch only - no new SQL])
    lookup -->|No| check{Policy authority and permit valid}
    check -->|No| denied([Reject before dispatch])
    check -->|Yes| capacity{Reserve bounded run capacity}
    capacity -->|No| denied
    capacity -->|Yes| accepted[[Admit and bind reservation epoch with version CAS]]
    accepted --> intent[[Persist fresh-authorized dispatch intent]]
    intent --> run[Run exact approved SQL]
    run --> cancel{Cancel requested}
    cancel -->|No| result[Observe statement and transaction outcome]
    cancel -->|Yes| barrier[Hold next-run admission barrier]
    barrier --> target[[Cancel exact physical execution epoch]]
    target --> settled{Cancel settlement and protocol known}
    settled -->|No| retire[Retire physical session]
    retire --> uncertainty([Unknown write or interrupted read])
    settled -->|Yes| result
    result --> evidence{Target outcome conclusive}
    evidence -->|No| unknown([Persist outcome unknown])
    evidence -->|Yes| final[Persist observed outcomes]
    final --> sync[Observe protocol and physical cleanup settlement]
    sync --> done([Release next-run barrier])
    done --> retained[Bounded terminal data LRU - preserve durable operation]
